ikan (µL)\"},{\"id\":\"waktu_retensi\",\"label\":\"Waktu Retensi\"},{\"id\":\"respon_puncak\",\"label\":\"Respon Puncak\"}],\"default_rows\":[{\"tahap\":\"Spiked Sample 1\",\"wadah_zat\":\"\",\"wadah_sisa\":\"\",\"bobot_bersih\":\"\",\"faktor_pengenceran\":\"\",\"konsentrasi\":\"\",\"vol_suntik\":\"\",\"waktu_retensi\":\"\",\"respon_puncak\":\"\"}]}]},{\"id\":\"regresi_kurva_baku\",\"title\":\"E. Regresi Linear Kurva Baku Kafein\",\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"persamaan_regresi\",\"label\":\"Persamaan Regresi Linear (y = bx + a)\",\"type\":\"text\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"slope\",\"label\":\"Slope (b)\",\"type\":\"number\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"intercept\",\"label\":\"Intercept (a)\",\"type\":\"number\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"koefisien_korelasi\",\"label\":\"Koefisien Korelasi (r) — Syarat r >= 0.998\",\"type\":\"number\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"koefisien_determinasi\",\"label\":\"Koefisien Determinasi (R²)\",\"type\":\"number\",\"readonly\":true}]},{\"id\":\"perhitungan_kadar_kafein\",\"title\":\"F. Perhitungan Kadar Kafein, Presisi Duplo & Kadar Kafein Anhidrat\",\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"kadar_replikasi_1\",\"label\":\"Kadar Kafein 1\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"mg/kg\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"kadar_replikasi_2\",\"label\":\"Kadar Kafein 2\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"mg/kg\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"kadar_rata_mg\",\"label\":\"Rata-rata Kadar Kafein\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"mg/kg\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"kadar_rata_persen\",\"label\":\"Rata-rata Kadar Kafein\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"rpd\",\"label\":\"Presisi Duplo (RPD)\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"syarat_horwitz\",\"label\":\"Syarat 1/2 CV Horwitz\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"kadar_air_1\",\"label\":\"Kadar Air I\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"%\"},{\"id\":\"kadar_air_2\",\"label\":\"Kadar Air II\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"%\"},{\"id\":\"kadar_air_rata\",\"label\":\"Rata-rata Kadar Air\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"kadar_anhidrat_mg\",\"label\":\"Kadar Kafein Anhidrat\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"mg/kg\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"kadar_anhidrat_persen\",\"label\":\"Kadar Kafein Anhidrat\",\"type\":\"number\",\"unit\":\"%\",\"readonly\":true}]},{\"id\":\"hasil_kesimpulan\",\"title\":\"G. LOD/LOQ, Pustaka & Kesimpulan\",\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"lod_nilai\",\"label\":\"LOD (Limit of Detection)\",\"type\":\"text\",\"placeholder\":\"Contoh: 0.05\"},{\"id\":\"lod_satuan\",\"label\":\"Satuan LOD\",\"type\":\"text\",\"default\":\"mg/kg\"},{\"id\":\"loq_nilai\",\"label\":\"LOQ (Limit of Quantification)\",\"type\":\"text\",\"placeholder\":\"Contoh: 0.15\"},{\"id\":\"loq_satuan\",\"label\":\"Satuan LOQ\",\"type\":\"text\",\"default\":\"mg/kg\"},{\"id\":\"hasil_uji_identifikasi\",\"label\":\"Hasil Uji (Identifikasi)\",\"type\":\"text\",\"placeholder\":\"Contoh: Positif Kafein / Sesuai Baku Pembanding\"},{\"id\":\"hasil_uji_kadar_akhir\",\"label\":\"Hasil Uji ± Ketidakpastian + Simple Acceptance/Guard Band*\",\"type\":\"text\",\"placeholder\":\"Contoh: 1250 ± 45 mg/kg\"},{\"id\":\"pustaka_metode\",\"label\":\"Pustaka Metode\",\"type\":\"text\",\"default\":\"MA PPOM 21/PA/15\"},{\"id\":\"pustaka_persyaratan\",\"label\":\"Pustaka Persyaratan\",\"type\":\"text\",\"default\":\"PBPOM No 11 Tahun 2019\"},{\"id\":\"syarat\",\"label\":\"Syarat (Tolerance Limit / Acceptance Limit)\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"placeholder\":\"Contoh: Tidak kurang dari ... / Maksimal ...\"},{\"id\":\"kesimpulan\",\"label\":\"Kesimpulan\",\"type\":\"select\",\"options\":[\"MS\",\"TMS\",\"Tidak Ditentukan\"],\"required\":true}]}]}',
